title: "CoNNGaFit: Convolutional Neural Networks for Galaxy Fitting"
abstract: >-
  Convolutional neural networks that infer galactic properties, such as the radial
  mass flux and rotational velocity of neutral gas, from HI 21cm spectral datacubes.
